WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:05.430
chuckle what is more important in being
successful at achieving your goals

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:15.389
nature or nurture okay so this is the
classic question of nature versus

00:00:15.389 --> 00:00:28.039
nurture and in my opinion it's neither
then my whole life I've seen people from

00:00:28.039 --> 00:00:34.170
every different strata in a SEAL Teams
you had everybody you had

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:40.170
Ivy League kids with a silver spoon and
you had former gangbangers and hoodrats

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:45.180
and the same time you had prep school
kids and kids from blue-collar families

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:53.070
and everybody in between there was kids
with the big strong families that were

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:58.320
really really close he had kids with no
families kids that were pampered and

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:03.270
kids that were abused everything we had
everything and in all of those different

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:09.540
groups there were some people that were
successful and got the job done and some

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:15.450
people that were unsuccessful and
couldn't get it done and in working with

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:19.799
businesses now I see the same thing
people from every walk of life from the

00:01:19.799 --> 00:01:25.470
bottom to the top and I've seen every
type of those different types of people

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:38.520
be successful so to me it's not about
nature or nurture it's about choice the

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:43.740
people that are successful decide they
are going to be successful

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:50.939
they make that choice and they make
other choices they decide to study hard

00:01:50.939 --> 00:01:56.009
they choose to work hard they choose to
be the first person to get to work and

00:01:56.009 --> 00:02:04.409
the last person to go home they choose
to take on the hard jobs and take on the

00:02:04.409 --> 00:02:12.860
challenges they decide that they're
gonna lead when no one else will

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:19.960
they choose who they're gonna hang
around with and be associated with and

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:24.450
they choose who they're going to emulate

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:31.860
these people choose to become who they
want to become

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:43.090
they aren't inhibited by nature or
nurture they overcome both and I'll tell

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:47.380
you something else it's never too late
to make that choice you're never too old

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:54.130
to decide where you're going to focus
your efforts and push to make the most

00:02:54.130 --> 00:03:08.830
out of every situation so to me it's not
about what you've been through and where

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:16.800
you were it's about where you're going

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:24.730
and it's about the choices that you make
it's about choosing choose to make

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:32.680
yourself smarter and stronger and
healthier choose to workout and study

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:45.130
and eat good food and keep your mind
clean don't let nature or nurture make

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:58.470
you choose to make yourself

